  "title": "Braised Beef Shank with Wine and Tarragon",
  "description": "This beef shank recipe uses a flavorful braising liquid of Marsala wine, beef broth, and tarragon for fall-off-the-bone beef for an easy, hearty meal.",
  "authors": [
