  "ingredients": [
    "2 tablespoons olive oil",
    "2 pounds beef shank",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste",
    "1 onion, cut into 1/2-inch cubes",
    "2 stalks celery, cut into 1/2-inch cubes",
    "1 cup Marsala wine",
    "1 (14 ounce) can beef broth",
    "1 cup water, or as needed",
    "2 tablespoons dried tarragon"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yEdYB7dK9rrQydObC95j2eSoyPU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235528-braised-beef-shank-with-wine-and-tarragon-DDMFS-step-1-BG-2503-961d4b14880f456587912af7fa598e05.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235528/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 300 degrees F (150 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat olive oil in an oven-proof deep skillet with a lid over medium-high heat. Season beef shank with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1KyyVErW9APxFrP_7juwHVk_sHU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235528-braised-beef-shank-with-wine-and-tarragon-DDMFS-step-2-BG-2507-791c99b5a8244c89971910fd0fe516de.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235528/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook beef shank in hot oil until browned on all sides, 5 to 10 minutes. Transfer beef shank to a plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fcbN-u4sC_qZBq4bYBMIkHu-6xc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235528-braised-beef-shank-with-wine-and-tarragon-DDMFS-step-3-BG-2513-9550de10469447fd87b984ea6a21d8c1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235528/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sauté onion and celery in the same skillet until onion turns translucent, 5 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7p7KfR_mKhD-_Ih-OcaelocENX4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235528-braised-beef-shank-with-wine-and-tarragon-DDMFS-step-4-BG-2516-415ad161982a4c34a19ea167abfd4e5d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235528/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour in wine and bring to a boil while scraping the browned bits of food off of the bottom of the pan with a wooden spoon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YGV1uAmOuhtDct7KvGczRibiQDA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235528-braised-beef-shank-with-wine-and-tarragon-DDMFS-step-5-BG-2520-728628ce10ad4e69adf936c73afb98f3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235528/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place beef shank into onion-wine mixture; add beef broth and pour in enough water to cover 1/2 to 3/4 of the beef shank. Sprinkle tarragon over shank; cover the skillet with a lid.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XCufAGLT4OJCGwnnl1ufc5QcTSQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235528-braised-beef-shank-with-wine-and-tarragon-DDMFS-step-6-BG-2527-76257ec5e8944f6080f24d33627f25a5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235528/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until meat falls off the bone, about 5 hours. Season with salt and pepper before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_xcy8GFpKv5cAVIbislgcSYK3qQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235528-braised-beef-shank-with-wine-and-tarragon-DDMFS-step-7-BG-2679-cbb2af633837496189cb600bd9c9fc7f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235528/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
